<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">JUDA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Juda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Juda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Juda</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="rem">MN, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Yame no Juda mupika Yesu Krisitu, karo yame no mina Jakovo. Naa ñorera amwe na mwithsiwa no ku shimiwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mweya kwaa amba ci </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Awa a kenithsiwa.”</char></note> kwa Nyambi Tata no ku nyungiwa nawa kwa Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Ñeke, thsiyaro no thsishimo ikare nenu kongi.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwimanena Oshemwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Ashimiwa ange, shime na ni foto nene ci ni mi ñorere yo kuyoyithsiwa oku tu ciera twahe. Na ni mono ci ku di nawa ci ni mi ñorere ku mi romba ci mu rwere thsitawo ethsi na a pa Nyambi anuenthzi owakenu rofoci, karo ro mahurerero. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Inene anu amweya o kukana ku tawa nengena muvudi mu kaci kenu. Awo anu awo raturo thzo thza ñoriwire ku kare, aa tengurura thsihemo thsa Nyambi kwikara dikuñwa dyo ku kwamena ongurunde no ku hamura Ñathsire no Fumu wetu yofoci Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Shaanga ci na mu dimuka kare yoihe eyi, naa fota ku mi vurukithsa ci Fumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mañoro amweya aa amba ci Yesu.</char></note> wa paturire anuenthzi mu ditunga dya Egepita, unone ku rupara wa thzirithsire kukwo awa a kanine ku tawa. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Karo tungeru otu twa kanine ku cikwathsithsa nawa eturo yato, unone twa thsiire mandau ato, Nyambi na a nyungera otu tungeru mu madyenge o diyere mu ndau thzo mirema ku taterera diyuwa dyodikuru dyo raturo. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Mofoci, Sodoma na Gomora no mambongi aa a cihatire nao engenine mu ruthziho no ku koña ecikumbwethza yerama. Nyambi wa pire humbithso thzo mudiro ao mambongi ci ikare nomenithso thzo mudiro o diyere o raturo thza Nyambi.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Mofoci nowa anu awa, aemana perota yo, aa thsireka erama yo no ku kana okoro wa Nyambi no ku yengwera o kutethzima awa a di mu wiru. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Unone shaanga Mikaele mukuru o tungeru ou a cikanyekire na shamaonga yerama ya Mushe, Mikaele ka a keshukire ku ratura shamaonga pa ku yengwa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amweya aa thzi yuvithsithsa ci: “Mikaele ka a keshukire ku ratura shamaonga ko ku mu yengwera.”</char></note> unone wa ambire pohuma ci: “Fumu a ku kuturure!” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Unone awa anu aa shwahura enu eyi a na kana ku yuvithsithsa. Karo enu eyi a yuvithsithsa ko thserekerera, eci eyama yo kupira maano, yodiyo ya ku wa retera kunongithsiwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Akwothsimo awa anu! Inene a na shimbi dikuñwa dya Kaine, karo mukaci ko ku shima nene madi na cimbunju eci Balaami, karo na cithziri mu kupirukera kwo Nyambi eci Kora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Mata 4.3-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22">Muta 22</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16">16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Awa anu aa cipitura eci okaru ou u na cihoreka pa mapondapondera, aa dya nenu ko kukana ku fera honyi ekwama yo yoimango, adithsani awa a cinyunga awo pohuma kupita ku nyunga mangu. Aa cipitura eci mavui o kupira mvura, aa pepumukithsiwa ku mupepo. Karo aa cipitura eci etondo yo kupira ima mu thsikati thso mvura, yaa tongoriwa no ku fa rwidi. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Aa cipitura eci mañithsingi oa anthzi o mu diwate, aa tupura difuthzi dyenu yo kufithsa honyi. Aa cipitura eci matungwethzi aa a yembaera, inene Fumu o na wa turekera mirema thzothziru thzo diyere.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Enoke, aye o mukuta o muthsitanu na thzidi ku tunda kwa Adama, wokethzire keyi yowa anu awa ci: “O mone, Fumu aa keya nanuenthzi owakenu o tukore na tukore, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />ku na ratura anu wahe. Kenge a ku na pa murandu akwakukana ku tawa mukaci ketenda yoimango eyi na tende, no maywi oahe oamango aa na amba anu wevi o ku rwithsa Nyambi.” <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Awa anu po akwa ku tatoka no ku cithsimoka, aa shupwera pohuma ecikumbwethza yo yo thsivi. Aa cinuneka nene athsinda, karo aa shangaranga anu amweya ci a wane thsimweya ku kwo.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku cithzua mucima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Uno honi amwe, ashimiwa ange, mu vuruke eyi twa mi amberire tunganda twa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Shime twa mi amberire ci: “Mu mayuwa o mahurerero kenge kwa kwikara akwamushepuruthzi, awa a ku shupwera ecikumbwethza yo yoimango.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Awa anu awa wodiyo awa a reta kucitepatepa mu kaci kenu. Aa shupwera mianekerero thzo thzo thserekerera, karo ka di no Mupepo wa Nyambi.<verse eid="JUD 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Unone amwe, ashimiwa ange, mu ciumbe oandu mu thsitawo thsenu thsothsikenu nene no ku rombera ko Mupepo Oukenu. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Mwikare mu thsishimo thsa Nyambi o ku mu taterera ñeke thza Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu ku mi retera mwoyo o diyere. <verse eid="JUD 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Mu fere ñeke awa a tamangera. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Mu yoyithse amweya ko ku wa yokora mu mudiro. Mu monithse ñeke kwamweya ko ku yapa Nyambi, unone mu thzimbe shaanga thsikoveyo thso ku rambera omango o thsivi.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyemekera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Ku kwenthzi aye o ku twethsa ku mi nyunga ci mwa kuñuka, no ku mi reta ko kupira kapongonyi pa meho o kutethzima kwenthzi ko thsinyanyu thsothsikuru, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />ku kwenthzi aye Nyambi yofoci, aye Muyoyithsi wetu ka Yesu Krisitu Fumu wetu kwikare kutethzima, ofumu, okoro noendithsi, ku tatekera ekati yoihe o ku i shime, no pano tu di no diyere! Ameni.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>